cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and Chang Cheng's dissertation when using this package."
type: software
title: "Supervised NMF for Classification"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
repository-code: "https://github.com/cheng338/supervised-nmf"
authors:
  - family-names: Cheng
    given-names: Chang
abstract: >-
  Supervised nonnegative matrix factorization for binary classification, using
  feature screening, nonnegative factorization and classification.
  Implements the supervised NMF methodology in Chapter 7 of Chang Cheng's
  dissertation, Ensemble Kernel Distance-Weighted Discrimination and Supervised
  Nonnegative Matrix Factorization for Classification, from the original
  simulation and CelebA experiment scripts.

